SamDrucker is a collection of small components which create a centralized list
of all packages on all hosts.

This port installs the reporting website: a small, read-only PHP site for
browsing that list. It shows every host and when it last checked in, the
packages and repositories on each host, which hosts have a given package and
in which version, and every repository in use. Every result table can be
downloaded as CSV or JSON.

The website lists the exact package versions on every host, so serve it on
an internal network only.
